<title>UK: Citicorp sets $300 mln FRN due 2004.</title>
<headline>Citicorp sets $300 mln FRN due 2004.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Citibank International and JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITICORP</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    27.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.79     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.79</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5	 SELL CONC  12.5	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE FROM 27.FEB.01 AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
